        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 55 Killinarden Estate to the market—an impressive extended three-bedroom terraced home ideally positioned within one of Tallaght's most mature, established and convenient residential locations.\nBeautifully maintained and generously proportioned throughout, this exceptional home offers bright, versatile living accommodation extending to approximately 152 sq. m (1,636 sq. ft.), making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, growing families, and those seeking additional living space.\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious front living room, and a superb open-plan kitchen, dining and family room to the rear, creating the perfect setting for both everyday living and entertaining. Upstairs boasts three generously sized bedrooms, including a principal bedroom complete with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, together with a well-appointed family bathroom.\nExternally, the property benefits from a low-maintenance private rear garden with convenient rear access, while the front offers a driveway providing valuable off-street parking.\nKillinarden Estate is a highly sought-after and well-established neighbourhood, renowned for its excellent range of local amenities. Residents enjoy easy access to a selection of primary and secondary schools, local shops, parks, sporting facilities and regular public transport links. Tallaght Village, The Square Shopping Centre, TU Dublin Tallaght Campus, Tallaght University Hospital and the M50 motorway are all just minutes away, ensuring exceptional convenience for commuters and families alike.\nCombining spacious, well-designed accommodation with an outstanding location, No. 55 Killinarden Estate represents a superb opportunity to acquire a wonderful family home in the heart of Tallaght. Early viewing is strongly advised—contact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today to arrange your appointment.\n\nDetails\n3 bed, 2 bath\nMid-terrace property\nDouble story extension\nc.152 sqm\nBuilt c.1978\nLow maintenance rear garden complete with rear access\nDriveway with off-street parking\nMature and well-established residential location\nOil fired central heating\nDouble Glazed Windows\nClose to local shops, schools & amenities\nExcellent public transport links nearby\nIdeal for a wide range of buyers\nEarly viewing is highly advised!\n\nBER\nBER: C\n\nDirections\nEircode: D24 W7K7"
